  "ruleText": "PART He-W 899 RESERVED\n\nAPPENDIX A: Incorporation by Reference Information\n\nRule | Title | Publisher; How to Obtain; and Cost\n\nHe-W 837.04(a)(1) | ASAM Criteria: Treatment Criteria for Substance-Related, Addictive, and Co-Occurring Conditions, 3rd edition (2013) | Publisher: American Society of Addiction Medicine (ASAM). The ASAM Criteria (2013) can be purchased online through the ASAM website at: http://www.asamcriteria.org/. Cost = $95 (non-members) or $85 (members). Discounts are available for large purchases.\n\nAPPENDIX B",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
